    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nBack to listing\nBLUEINK + SALESFORCE\nClose Deals Faster with the Blueink and Salesforce Integration\n\nBoost Salesforce’s efficiency by integrating Blueink. Enable your sales team to manage documents, close deals faster, and provide a seamless customer experience.\n\nGet a demo\nClose Deals Faster with Blueink and Salesforce Working Together\nAutomatically Send Envelopes for New Leads in Salesforce\n\nYou can automatically send envelopes to your new leads as soon as they’re saved in Salesforce. This helps you respond quickly and close deals faster.\n\nAutomatically Upload Completed Envelopes to Salesforce\n\nCompleted envelopes and their certificates of evidence are automatically uploaded to Salesforce File Home when they’re ready for download. This keeps all your important documents organized and accessible in one place.\n\nWho Uses the Blueink for Salesforce Integration?\nSales\nSales team can use the Blueink and Salesforce integration to send contracts, proposals, and agreements directly from Salesforce. This allows sales reps to quickly get documents signed without leaving the platform, helping them close deals faster and keep track of which documents are signed.\nHuman Resources\nFor HR, the integration makes it easy to manage employee documents like contracts, onboarding paperwork, and NDAs. HR teams can send documents for e-signature through Salesforce and track their status, ensuring they stay updated on signatures without switching between tools.\nIT\nIT department benefits from automating document workflows like internal approvals and security agreements. With the Blueink and Salesforce integration, IT teams can send documents for e-signature and track their progress, helping them manage compliance and internal processes more efficiently.\nEnhancing signer experiences, building trust\n50%\nMore cost-effective\nthan DocuSign\n4.9/5\nCustomer\nsatisfaction score\n3 min\nAverage support response time\n0\nZero overage\npenalties\nSee what our partners have to say\nMarketing and Advertising\nAdam R.\nSales Director\nExceptional digital signature technology for less than the competition\nThis is an exceptional product for digital signature for less than the competition.\nTechnology\nAli P.\nVP Sales Engineering\nGreat flexible product with easy integration and customer support\nGreat company with very flexible tools and excellent customer experience.\nHospitality\nAmy K.\nDirector of Sales\nMakes my life much easier!\nThe two biggest positive changes are how much time I save completing the contract process and how quickly I receive the signed contracts back from the client.\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nFinancial Services\nAyaz S.\nManagement Consultant\nGreat Product and Value\nGreat value compared to other products and was easy to implement within our platforms. The company provides white glove service and support.\nGovernment\nBeth M.\nHuman Resources & Compliance\nHuman Resources paperwork streamlined\nBlueInk has streamlined our processes to ensure that all the required paperwork is collected in a timely manner with the proper signature.\nFAQs\nHow do I set up the Blueink and Salesforce integration?\n\nTo set up the integration, simply go to the Blueink Marketplace and connect Salesforce to your Blueink account.\n\n‍\n\nCan I automate sending documents to new leads in Salesforce?\n\nYes! With this integration, you can automatically send envelopes to new leads as soon as they’re added to Salesforce, helping you act quickly and close deals faster.\n\nCan I customize the Salesforce workflow?\n\nYes, you can. Just go to the Blueink connect section and start creating your own custom flow with Salesforce.\n\nDoes the Blueink and Salesforce integration have security features?\n\nYes, our integration with Salesforce includes security features to ensure your documents and data are protected. Blueink complies with industry standards such as HIPAA and GDPR, ensuring that all transactions are secure and confidential.\n\nCan your team help me customize the integration?\n\nYes, we can! We can create custom integrations tailored to your specific workflows. Feel free to email us at integration@blueink.com for assistance.\n\nReady to get started?\nGet in touch with Blueink.\nStart Free 14-Day Trial!\nFEATURES\nBulk Send\nSMS Delivery\nSmart Link Forms\nSigning Brands\nTeams\nIn-Person Signing\nSOLUTIONS\nINDUSTRY\nGovernment\nEducation\nHealthcare\nHousing\nInsurance\nStaffing\nSenior Living\n\nFinancial Services\nRetail\nTechnology\nDEPARTMENT\nFinance\nProcurement\nHuman Resources\nCourts\nLegal\nSales\nOperations\nCivil Service\nIT\nCOMPARE BLUEINK\nvs Adobe Sign\nvs DocuSign\nvs Dropbox Sign\nvs Foxit Sign\nvs PandaDoc\nvs SignNow\nAPI\nAPI Overview\nAPI SDKs & Libraries\nDocumentation\nAPI Plans & Pricing\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nWhite Papers\nCase Studies\nCompetitors\neSignature Laws\nHelp Center\nSample Documents\nFAQ\nCompliance\nSystem Status\nQUICK LINKS\nHome\nAbout Us\nPricing\nIntegration\nPartner\n\nContact Us\n2014 – 2026 © Blueink. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nCookies Policy"
